      "containing 'nlolib-example-parameters: begin' and one containing",
      "'nlolib-example-parameters: end'. The block must hold exactly 'params'.",
      "'derived' is computed below the block and is not checked. All examples",
      "use backend 'auto' and print 'metrics' with the same labels.",
      "record_bytes = samples x records x 16.",
      "",
      "Not validated by a run: the reduced grids of tensor_dispersion_3d and",
      "high_order_grin_soliton and the raman_scattering grid are sized by",
      "arithmetic. The Python implementation runs each once and may correct",
      "the numbers here before the other two bindings copy them."
